# Game Architecture Rules

## GameDefinition interface (src/core/types.ts)
```typescript
interface GameDefinition {
  id: string;          // lowercase: 'empareja2', 't1mer', etc.
  name: string;        // display name: 'Empareja2', 'T1mer', etc.
  type: string;        // UPPERCASE: 'EMPAREJA2', 'T1MER', etc.
  colors: {
    primary: string;   // hex color for game theme
    accent: string;    // hex accent color
  };
  GameScreen: React.ComponentType<GameScreenProps>;
  GameConfig: React.ComponentType<GameConfigProps>;
}
```

